<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Pursue Him and seize Him, Christ the supreme.</l><l>Just love this precious Person.</l><l>Forgetting and leaving all other things,</l><l>Love Him with your whole being.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ now is my center and reality,</l><l>My life for eternity.</l><l>All things are just dung compared to Him,</l><l>So love and just gain Him!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
